Q1.
Which lines cause a compile error?

Code:
class A {
    A(int x) { }
}

class B extends A {
    B() { }                      // L1
    B(int x) { super(x); }       // L2
}

class C extends A { }            // L3

A. Only L1
B. Only L3
C. L1 and L3
D. L1, L2 and L3


